0..51 Comment "//! This fixture defines a universe with two codes."
52..55 Comment "//!"
56..90 Comment "//! Each code decodes to one type."
91..94 Comment "//!"
95..175 Comment "//! A case reads each value at its decoded type. The case generalises its motive"
176..255 Comment "//! over the value. The kernel checks the case at that motive. The machine runs"
256..280 Comment "//! the case as written."
281..284 Comment "//!"
